      "text": "/// Packet is a wire frame with bit fields.\nstruct Packet {\n  std::uint8_t version : 4;\n  std::uint8_t flags : 4;\n  std::uint16_t length;\n  char* payload;\n\n  /// Header is nested in Packet.\n  struct Header {\n    std::uint32_t magic;\n    bool valid() const { return magic == 0xC1u; }\n  };\n\n  enum class Kind : std::uint8_t { Data, Ack };\n\n  Header header;\n  Kind kind = Kind::Data;\n}",
      "hash": "3adbbc099c19a06c604d878fe9336232722c505ebe1a3bf7d0a972308e67f402"
